{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "KJV1769",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 55,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.55.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.55.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Give ear to my prayer, O God; and hide not thyself from my supplication.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.55.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.55.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Attend unto me, and hear me: I mourn in my complaint, and make a noise;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.55.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.55.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Because of the voice of the enemy, because of the oppression of the wicked: for they cast iniquity upon me, and in wrath they hate me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.55.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.55.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My heart is sore pained within me: and the terrors of death are fallen upon me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.55.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.55.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Fearfulness and trembling are come upon me, and horror hath overwhelmed me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.55.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.55.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And I said, Oh that I had wings like a dove! ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "for then",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " would I fly away, and be at rest.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.55.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.55.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Lo, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "then",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " would I wander far off, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " remain in the wilderness. Selah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.55.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.55.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I would hasten my escape from the windy storm ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " tempest.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.55.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.55.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Destroy, O Lord, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " divide their tongues: for I have seen violence and strife in the city.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.55.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.55.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Day and night they go about it upon the walls thereof: mischief also and sorrow ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the midst of it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.55.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.55.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wickedness ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the midst thereof: deceit and guile depart not from her streets.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.55.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.55.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not an enemy ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " reproached me; then I could have borne ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it:",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " neither ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he that hated me ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " did magnify ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "himself",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " against me; then I would have hid myself from him:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.55.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.55.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thou, a man mine equal, my guide, and mine acquaintance.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.55.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.55.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "We took sweet counsel together, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " walked unto the house of God in company.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.55.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.55.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let death seize upon them, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " let them go down quick into hell: for wickedness ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in their dwellings, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " among them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.55.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.55.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As for me, I will call upon God; and the LORD shall save me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.55.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.55.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Evening, and morning, and at noon, will I pray, and cry aloud: and he shall hear my voice.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.55.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.55.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He hath delivered my soul in peace from the battle ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " against me: for there were many with me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.55.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.55.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "God shall hear, and afflict them, even he that abideth of old. Selah. Because they have no changes, therefore they fear not God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.55.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.55.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He hath put forth his hands against such as be at peace with him: he hath broken his covenant.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.55.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.55.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The words",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of his mouth were smoother than butter, but war ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in his heart: his words were softer than oil, yet ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " they drawn swords.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.55.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.55.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Cast thy burden upon the LORD, and he shall sustain thee: he shall never suffer the righteous to be moved.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.55.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.55.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But thou, O God, shalt bring them down into the pit of destruction: bloody and deceitful men shall not live out half their days; but I will trust in thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
